ORDER BY 1;
                QUERY PLAN                
------------------------------------------
 Sort
   Sort Key: t1.x COLLATE case_sensitive
   ->  Hash Left Join
         Hash Cond: (t1.x = (t2.x)::text)
         ->  Seq Scan on test3cs t1
         ->  Hash
               ->  Seq Scan on test3cs t2
(7 rows)

