WHERE x = 'abc' COLLATE case_sensitive;
                      QUERY PLAN                      
------------------------------------------------------
 Subquery Scan on s
   Filter: (s.x = 'abc'::text COLLATE case_sensitive)
   ->  HashAggregate
         Group Key: pushdown_ci.x
         ->  Seq Scan on pushdown_ci
(5 rows)

